# --- Reference materials (large; not application code) ---
# NOTE: .gitignore has NO quoting syntax — a quoted pattern is matched
# literally (quotes included) and silently fails. Paths with spaces are written
# unquoted; internal spaces are significant, so keep them exact.
PHOTOS/
UI AND FEATURES PHOTO REFERENCE/
ALL THE CONTENT:IDEA MAIN OVERVIEW OF PROJECT.pages
ALL THE CONTENT:IDEA MAIN OVERVIEW OF PROJECT.pdf
The Phases COMPLETE !.pages
The Phases COMPLETE !.pdf
NEPSE_Mega_Tool_106_Screenshot_Analysis.pdf
PRAVAHA.pdf
logoFimage.png

