# --- Personal trading records (private; never commit) ---
# WRITTENdata.pdf is a 7.3 MB handwritten personal trading journal. It is a data
# SOURCE for local analysis only. Its contents are private, so neither the PDF
# nor anything extracted from it is committed.
WRITTENdata.pdf
Written Data.pdf
Written_Data_All_52_Pages_Digitized.xlsx
Written_Data_Full_Transcription.xlsx
# Secondary digitizations of WRITTENdata.pdf produced outside this repo
# (NotebookLM / ChatGPT). They restate the same private trades, holdings,
# watchlists and EPS, so they are private for exactly the same reason — even
# though the code reads them, megatool/written_reference.py.
digitized_trading_ledger_and_notes.md
